  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that RNA-only multiprofile models with scvi_n200 encoder and transformer aggregation (config_006) achieve the highest accuracy so far (0.653). This experiment tests scgpt encoder with transformer aggregation in the same multiprofile setting, isolating the effect of the RNA encoder. It directly compares scgpt (a more complex encoder) against scvi_n200, helping determine if encoder choice outweighs aggregation method. This balances exploitation of the promising transformer aggregation and exploration of encoder alternatives, avoiding redundant changes while addressing key uncertainty."
